      "id": "claim_14376f9edb5e49d2b4a655df2632d4cf",
      "statement": "Data minimization is enforced in code: RAW_COLUMNS is a closed column list and the Home Credit loader reads the CSV with usecols=RAW_COLUMNS, so only those columns of the 122 in application_train.csv are loaded.",
