    {
      "id": "claim_6af9dae477ac467fb17808a5d97f8c78",
      "statement": "The README documents an LGPD plan as intent rather than audited compliance: personal-data inventory, legal bases (art. 7 X and V), art. 18 and 20 data-subject rights, controller/operator/DPO roles, and retention periods (project data deleted at end, 5 years negative information, 15 years repayment history). Its 'Próximos trabalhos recomendados' list still includes recording minimization, purpose, legal-basis, access-control and retention policies, and its governance section says the group-AUC check does not prove fairness or LGPD compliance. Pseudonymization of SK_ID_CURR, individual explanations, human review, a DPO channel and deletion workflows are production plans not implemented in code.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L633-L648",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c581639a1ce2d2ab7f7ad8a2e301375eefd1de9701ac6f542ffddd21b3d7b7e7:"
